    {
      "kind": "wordplay",
      "subject": "פשע...פשע",
      "rationale": "Wanpela tok i kamap tupela taim long wanpela sentens — daunim bilong tok i lus long Tok Pisin."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Yu ol i mas tokim Yosef olsem: Mi askim yu, plis, harim — lusim pasin rong bilong ol brata bilong yu na ol rong bilong ol, long wanem ol i wokim olgeta nogut long yu; na nau, plis, harim — lusim pasin rong bilong ol wokman bilong Elohim bilong papa bilong yu. Na Yosef i krai taim ol i tokim em.",
